<title>USA: Wausau Paper Mills Inc Q1 Nov 30 net up.</title>
<headline>Wausau Paper Mills Inc Q1 Nov 30 net up.</headline>
<dateline>WAUSAU, Wis. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		     $   0.30		   $ 0.20</p>
<p> Net			 11,114		    7,305</p>
<p> Revs		     139,639		  141,904</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  36,513		   36,831</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 net cut by $0.04 a share from a production problem at Brokaw mill. Two pressure vessels developed cracks reducing pulp production. All per share results adjusted for five-for-four stock split paid January 1996.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
